# Rerank ablation (A2): the exact-rerank candidate budget swept over
# k/2k/4k and the default (min(max(4*k,100),65536) = 100 here). Tighter
# windows truncate candidacy and report it; recall recovers as the window
# widens — the estimate-only order alone is not the answer.
recall k=10 samples=10 exact-rerank=10
----
recall@10: 92.00% (samples=10, truncated=10)
mean usage: visited_partitions=36 visited_leaf_entries=775 exact_rerank_candidates=10

recall k=10 samples=10 exact-rerank=20
----
recall@10: 100.00% (samples=10, truncated=10)
